# Build output. The binaries are large and platform-specific, and bin/ also holds the
# four Windows runtime DLLs that build.ps1 copies there (DEVIATIONS D-09).
bin/

# Hard rule, worth restating where it is easy to violate: NOTHING under ports/ may
# contain a model, a sample image, or a copy of any model.json. The data lives once,
# in document_processing/, and is located via RDOCS_MODELS_ROOT or by walking up from
# the executable. The instinctive fix when path resolution fails is to copy the models
# next to the binary -- and then 215 MB times four ports is in git history forever.
*.onnx
*.npz
*.npy
model.json
